# Testing

- Unit-test pure logic in `lib/` (e.g. roles helpers, rate-limit, parsers). Existing examples: `lib/role-utils.test.ts`, `lib/rate-limit.test.ts`.
- Prefer fixtures over live Sanity / Drive / Supabase network in unit tests.
- Every feature PR that adds logic must add or update tests. Docs-only / pure copy PRs may skip with an explicit N/A note.
- Keep suites fast and deterministic; do not call production CMS or banks in CI.
- When Playwright/e2e appears: smoke public home + one auth-gated happy path; keep e2e narrow.
